# Vendored data + reference clones are gitignored (large, content-addressed).
# What IS committed: MANIFEST.md (provenance narrative), sources.tsv (checksum
# manifest), fetch.sh (the fetch+verify+derive tool). Run `bash fetch.sh` to
# repopulate everything below from public origins.
slices/
large/
reference/
*.rds
*.gz
*.csv
*.xlsx

# ...but keep the committed manifest + tooling tracked.
!.gitignore
!MANIFEST.md
!sources.tsv
!fetch.sh
